        · exact ⟨(1165/512), (147/64), (21/40), (11/20), rectangle_valid_078, hcut12, hSh, hcut9, hcut0⟩
  · rcases le_total S (577/256) with hcut13 | hcut13
    · rcases le_total m (23/40) with hcut14 | hcut14
      · rcases le_total S (1143/512) with hcut15 | hcut15
